`pinact`'s `glob = List(".github/workflows/*", "*/action.*")`: since step globs are built without `literal_separator`, `*` crosses directories and nested metadata like `.github/actions/setup/action.yml` already matches — but a root-level `action.yml` (standalone action repos) never does, because the pattern requires a `/` before `action.`. `**/action.*` covers both.

